<title>POLAND: POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS - JANUARY 13.</title>
<headline>POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS - JANUARY 13.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in kerb trade through the Warsaw Stock Exchange was at 5.2 million zlotys on Monday.</p>
<p>The following is a summary of the day's block transactions on the Warsaw bourse.</p>
<p>* 30,000 variable-interest three-year bonds maturing on May 9, 1998, traded at 100.6 zlotys.</p>
<p>* 20,000 variable-interest three-year bonds maturing on May 9, 1998, traded at 100.7 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
